      "startClipIndex": 10,
      "endClipIndex": 15,
      "tone": "triumph"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch4",
      "title": "Grinding Through Summer",
      "description": "July and August are a battle of attrition — the Blue Jays win more than they lose but can't pull away, though Springer's explosive return offers a glimpse of what's coming.",
      "startClipIndex": 16,
      "endClipIndex": 20,
